<title>UK: Wolseley rises on stock switching.</title>
<headline>Wolseley rises on stock switching.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Wolseley Plc jumped to its highest level in four months on Wednesday as investors continued to pull out of building materials companies with high European exposure and moved into Wolseley stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1039 GMT, the shares were up 15p to 500, while others in the sector were generally flat to slightly weaker.</p>
